and\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(A)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这将Schnorr平凡性与K平凡性、Schnorr随机低性区分开来。陈述已与所供草稿逐项比对；书的优先构造证明未在本轮完整重证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorr-trivial","status":"resolved","id":"84713a230dd071da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-turing-red]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[43-df-jump]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-turing-red]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[43-df-jump]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-7","targ